{"id":"n76587-1-9","stage":5,"title":"직속 · 直属","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n76587-1-9-1","ko":"요새 지수 선배랑 친하게 지내는구나.","zh":"最近你和智秀学姐关系很好啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요새","meaning":"近来，日来，最近","explanation":"요새：近来，日来，最近","readings":[{"term":"요새","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67864","senseId":"1","lemma":"요새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요새","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3"}},{"text":"지수","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀","readings":[{"term":"지수","audio":"/audio/0d32317250d77806a4f2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수","audio":"/audio/0d32317250d77806a4f2.mp3"}},{"text":"선배랑","meaning":"前辈","explanation":"선배：前辈；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"선배","audio":"/audio/5a64f841df328061b03b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66306","senseId":"1","lemma":"선배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선배랑","audio":"/audio/449775e61d2eb70c2842.mp3"}},{"text":"친하게","meaning":"亲近，要好，亲密","explanation":"친하다：亲近，要好，亲密；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"친하다","audio":"/audio/0275722d7b511a470593.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80614","senseId":"1","lemma":"친하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친하게","audio":"/audio/75e93ba23a5770c052e1.mp3"}},{"text":"지내는구나.","meaning":"相处，交往","explanation":"지내다：相处，交往；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"2","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지내는구나","audio":"/audio/7272068dffa1d69ffced.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2e1177912c702a7a","term":"요새","zh":"近来，日来，最近","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3","entryId":"67864","definition":"从不久前到现在的非常短的期间。","pronunciation":["요새"]},{"id":"5a64f841df328061","term":"선배","zh":"前辈","audio":"/audio/5a64f841df328061b03