":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}},{"text":"챙겨","meaning":"照顾","explanation":"챙기다：照顾；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"챙기다","audio":"/audio/39b299d8d470abe5d844.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29778","senseId":"4","lemma":"챙기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"챙겨","audio":"/audio/3a3e7ad7b30bf414585e.mp3"}},{"text":"주셔.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주셔","audio":"/audio/b222dcf70819def6c766.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"6cccb622a0ceb39b","term":"직속","zh":"直属","audio":"/audio/6cccb622a0ceb39bfacd.mp3","entryId":"76587","definition":"直接归辖管属于某个组织或人；或指那样的所属。","pronunciation":["직쏙"]},{"id":"5a64f841df328061","term":"선배","zh":"前辈","audio":"/audio/5a64f841df328061b03b.mp3","entryId":"66306","definition":"在相同领域里比自己先开始活动而经验或地位等更领先的人。","pronunciation":["선배"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"39b299d8d470abe5","term":"챙기다","zh":"照顾","audio":"/audio/39b299d8d470abe5d844.mp3","entryId":"29778","definition":"关怀或照料某人。","pronunciation":["챙기다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]